    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78148" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρα-κέλευμα</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρα-κέλευσμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exhortation, cheering address</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				1155
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δεινὸν π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>IT</u>
					320
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἑνὸς</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφ᾽ ἑνὸς π.</span>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				15.32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				6.47
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>precept, maxim</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τοῦ Φωκυλίδου π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					407b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				688a
			</span></i>, al.</div>
